er satisfaction: 4.8/5.0\n\nMajor Milestones:\n- Launched mobile app\n- Secured partnership with TechCorp\n- Expanded team to 12 members\n\nWe're on track to meet our year-end goals. I'll be available for a call next week to discuss any questions you may have.\n\nBest regards,\nYou\n",
